# any NEXT_DIST_DIR side-build (QA servers, build gates, standalone smoke runs) —
# .next-qa*/ only covered the QA servers, so a `NEXT_DIST_DIR=.next-prod npm run build`
# left 400MB of build output showing up as untracked
.next-*/

# Portfolio material stays local (owner, 2026-07-28): the write-up, the 135MB of
# PNGs, and the capture scripts that regenerate them. Nothing here belongs to the
# election system itself.
docs/PORTFOLIO.md
docs/portfolio-shots/

# Local agent skill bundle (owner 2026-08-14). 94 files / 45,195 lines of SKILL.md
# and reference docs for the assistant's own tooling — nothing the election system
# runs on. Untracked it was still counted by the editor's branch diff, which read
# "+49,293" for a branch whose actual change is +3,562; ignoring it makes the
# number mean the work again. (AGENTS.md is deliberately NOT here — that one is
# project documentation, the sibling of the committed CLAUDE.md.)
.agents/
